  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CLIFF 10/11-14/15 - CLIFF Infra Financing</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CLIFF 10/11-14/15</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1. CLIFF avser att visa att gr&#xe4;srotsorganisation kan genomf&#xf6;ra        avancerade bostads- och infrastrukturprojekt i stor skala fr&#xe5;n &quot;ax    till limpa&quot;. M&#xe5;let med pilotprojektet &#xe4;r &#xe4;ven policyp&#xe5;verkan p&#xe5;       nationell och lokal niv&#xe5;. Denna fas avser &#xe4;ven expansion till 3-4 nya l&#xe4;nder f&#xf6;rutom de 3 i f&#xf6;reg&#xe5;ende fas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CLIFFs objectives are to show that CBOs can implement advanced        building- and infrastructure projects at a big scale as well as       policy impact at the national and local level. This phase will also   expand CLIFF into 3-4 new countries apart from the 3 in the previous  CLIFF-phase.</narrative>
  </description>
